/* ClipShot — Localizable.strings (English)
   Style: US English, professional but warm, simple words, no slang.
   The brand name "ClipShot" is never translated.
   File names (Captura …) and month folder names (Enero 2026 …) are intentionally
   NOT localized — they are written to the user's filesystem and must remain stable
   regardless of UI language. See main.swift for the matching code comments.
*/


